Package: send-matrix-mail
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Crooy.com B.V. <ronald@crooy.com>
Section: mail
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/yourorg/send-matrix-mail
Description: Drop-in sendmail replacement that delivers mail as Matrix messages
 send-matrix-mail is a sendmail-compatible Matrix client. It reads RFC 5322
 email from stdin, resolves recipients to Matrix delivery targets (DM, room,
 or default room), and posts an m.text message to each unique room.
 Messages are queued locally when the homeserver is unreachable and retried
 with exponential backoff.
 .
 Features:
  * Drop-in sendmail replacement — works with cron, PHP, monitoring tools
  * Local spool with exponential backoff for offline resilience
  * Three-tier recipient resolution: DM → named room → default room
  * Pure Go, single static binary, zero runtime dependencies
